<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 6, 2004 :: Papa finally gets his ring!</div><P>About time! We found the scout up and Papa got his Ring of Dain Frostreaver! Grats Kelrye on the Choker of the Wretched and the rest went to Greed rolls! </P>
<P>Grats Schena on 65 and Coercer!!<BR>Grats Mabh on 65 and Feral Lord <INSERT title="" here BST 65>and Baroness!<BR><BR>Grats Kelrye on completing your epic!<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/kelrye.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Arglar on Apr 7, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 4, 2004 :: Bah.. Login Servers down most of the day..</div><P>The few, the lucky, got online and never logged off in fear of being locked out. Those that went LD were mourned. </P>
<P>Thank you folks! Meeka finished her Coldain Shawl today! When I went to do my hand ins to the Dain first, I found he had a bit of a problem. . . <BR><IMG alt="Think Zorin took his pants.. and everything else?" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/elementaldain.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><BR>But, he didn't need his bottom half for the issue kit. While spawning the Avatar for the turn in, Arwa found us a friend, and Parn sweet talked him while we ran to get Reide to kill him. But he's so cute charmed.. look, he's giving a speech.. <BR><IMG alt="Speech! Speech!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stormfeather.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><BR><BR>After that, ran down to the King in Chardok fast to get Kelrye one of her last epic pieces. No luck on Ragefire being up in SolB though for the turn in. Soon! <BR><BR>Grats Utlail on 65 and Overlord! I hope it's overlord!<BR>Grats Talyranger on 50!!<BR>Who did I miss?</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 3, 2004 :: Some catching up again</div><P>Been a pretty quiet week, with Fan Fair and server downtime. Got a couple things done. </P>
<P>Grats Moriquendii on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/blessed_coldain_prayer_shawl.jpg">Blessed Prayer Coldain Shawl</A> of Goodness, or whatever it's called. <BR><BR>Went to Fear and got Haitful his epic fight done quicklike. Now just to get that last bit done so he can have his pulsy axe too. Maybe tomorrow! </P>
<P>A quick trip to the towers got a few more loots.. Grats Garacaius on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</A>, Sydna on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wand_of_the_Ice_Storm.gif">Wand of Ice Storm</A>, Grellk on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</A>, Kass saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/great_blade_of_storms.jpg">Great Blade of Storms</A> from rotting, Jen got a rune and Bearspirit got a spectral. </P>
<P>A run to NToV got someone an upgrade, and lots of others some crap to stick in the bank! Grats Punkgurl on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/reapers_ring.JPG">Reaper's Ring</A>! <BR>And the following people saved the following things from rot.. I think only a druid only shield really rotted since we had no druid there. Who needs seasons in NToV, right? Overrated. <BR>Bearspirit saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/cloak_sky.JPG">Cloak of the Sky</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/shield_wurms.JPG">Shield of the Wurms</A><BR>Thrakish saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/twisted_steel_gauntlets.JPG">Twisted Steel Gauntlets</A><BR>Vorne saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5901">Rocksmasher</A><BR>Mahrsan saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/silent_fang_necklace.JPG">Silent Fang Necklace<BR></A>Poyndexter saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/runed_fang_necklace.jpg">Runed Fang Necklace<BR></A>Utlail saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/claw_of_lightning.jpg">Claw of Lightning<BR></A>Colwn saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/shield_of_fury.JPG">Shield of Fury<BR></A>Punkgurl saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/shield_protector.jpg">Shield of the Protector</A><BR><BR>I didn't take any pictures, even though Mahrsan said to. Screw him! /ducks</P>
<P>Oh, and went to do the Ring War for Papa in between patches, and it was a bit broken. Apparently none of the giants wanted to come to the war. We sat around chatting wtih the coldain and the Seneschal for a bit, then gave up. Vorne went and killed a hero for fun. After five or six hours of no GM answering a petition to view the very broken quest, Kassandra just went down and killed the Seneschal to at least trigger a fail or something to reset the zone. Was muy lame. Hopefully it's fixed by now. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Apr 4, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 26, 2004 :: Holy Crap am I a slacker!</div><P>Finally.. finally! We find Manaetic Behemoth up AND get there before anyone else. No pictures were taken, of course, since he doesn't get to live long.&nbsp;Edit: I lied, Parn took a picture as we were setting up. <BR><BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/mb_01.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Loot grats to Kleria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/coil_twisted_platinum_wire.jpeg">Coil of Twisted Platinum Wire</A> and Vaea on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowing_steel_shim.jpg">Glowing Steel Shim</A>! &nbsp;</P>
<P>Grats Dawneylee on completing your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/nature_walkers_scimitar.jpg">Nature Walker's Scimitar</A>!<BR>Grats Shatta on completing your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler of Nem Ankh</A>!</P>
<P>Grats Haitful on 65 and Fury, our first Fury in the guild!<BR>Lots of other level updates I've missed.. will try to fill in here. Apologies to those not listed.. I still love you!</P>
<P>Some raid loots since the last time I updated. <BR>Zelcon on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/tunic_of_the_khati_sha.jpg">Tunic of Khati Sha</A>!<BR>Schena and Tellie on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowingorbofthestormwatcher.jpg">Glowing Orb of the Stormwatcher</A>!<BR>Sindall on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/cap_drowned_souls.jpg">Cap of Drowned Souls</A>!<BR>Tempys on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/stormriders_signet.jpg">Stormrider's Signet</A>!<BR>Kelnya on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/gargoyle_talon.jpg">Gargoyle Talon</A>! (thanks RD who didn't need for letting him come loot it)<BR>Reide and Grajin on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</A>!<BR>Lushissx on the greed roll for Plate Ornate Breastplate Mold!<BR>Dorina on the greed roll for Ornate Leather Tunic pattern!<BR>Balut on the greed roll for Ornate Chain Tunic pattern!<BR>Colwn on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</A>! <BR>Grellk on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/blackbladeoftherain.jpe">Blackblade of the Rain</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Twice_Forged_Steel_Bulwark.gif">Twice Forged Steel Bulwark</A>!<BR>Arwa on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/talisman_burrower.gif">Talisman of the Burrower</A>!<BR>Emmajo on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Wormhusk_Harness.jpg">Wormhusk Harness</A>!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 27, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 15, 2004 :: Filling in the holes... :)</div><P>Like Wonderbuns said, we finished up Sleeper's Tomb. First time seeing ancients, and no deaths (aside from theirs). And let me tell you.. that Kildrukaun the Ancient is a seriously long fight with 18 people... mostly knights. </P>
<P>It was 1 handed blunt day on the prismatic, and the clerics are all set to proc avatar now.. phew! We got three more people all the items for that <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/bladesouls_spiritual_diadem.jpg">Spiritual Diadum</A> quest.. grats Meeka, Balut and Mahrsan. And the Ancients dropped some toys. </P>
<P>DWARVES! Grats Parnicail and Kithik on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/besmirchedmask.jpg">Besmirched Mask of Conception</A>, Ceyria and Sindall both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/fasciasecundae.gif">Fascia Secundae</A>, Thayet on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/tenuousdragonscaleslippers.gif">Teneous Dragonscale Slippers</A>, we CoH'd Emanci down to loot some fistwraps and&nbsp;a second set rotted. And banks or rot gods got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Clandestine_Veil_of_MRata.jpg">Clandestine Veil of M'Rata</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/clawed_coat_tyro.JPG">Clawed Coat of Tyro</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/despondentshroud.jpg">Despondant Shroud</A>&nbsp;and another pair of those slippers. Feel like I'm forgetting something. I forgot to take a picture of the first dead ancient, but I remembered on the last three!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.myschief.com/files/userfiles/meeka/stancients.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>We also grabbed Grummus again and flagged a few more people this time. Grats Lumalie on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/diseasedratskinmask.gif">Diseased Ratskin Mask</A> and Traver on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/runed_lance_gryme.gif">Runed Lance of Grymme</A>. </P>
<P>Not only did Bryte finally get his snakey stick (thanks to the patch fixing that combine bug), but Lairiel finally got a SEoC and grabbed his <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=3637">Earthcaller</A>! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 14, 2004 :: Some More catchup!</div><P>Well its been a busy week!! We finally got around to clearing Sleepers Tomb, and getting more folks their quest pieces! </P>
<P>The following people have been leveling without permission. I shall have to group them soon to help them get back in line .. ;)</P>
<P>Tylokki - 64<BR>Lovem - 61<BR>Hedonista - 55<BR>Emmajo - 65<BR>Tearem - 61<BR>Perragon - 60<BR>Duktak - 59<BR>Zorin - 63<BR>Bamgoo - 43</P>
<P>Congrats to the winners!</P>
<P>One last piece of news.. and equally important is that our resident enchanter Brytelyte (ah nostalgia) completed his Staff of the Serpent!! Congratulations!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Mar 14, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 12, 2004 :: Ok ok.. catching up!</div><P>Aerin'Dar died again, but this time there were no paladin toys! Grats Kasserole on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/valorious_quarterstaff.jpg">Valorious Quarterstaff</A> and Barell on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wrath_of_Mithanial.jpeg">Wrath of Mithaniel</A>! Was clearly staff day </P>
<P>Somehow I missed updating the mighty Zorholio and his cleric epic. So, it's a week or two late, but Grats Zorin on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler</A>! I'll have to get a picture and add it.. without pants of course! </P>
<P>Killed the mama snake and the papa snake, baby snake was already dead, of course. Grats to Shatta on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/scalemesh_leggings.jpg">Scale Mesh Leggings</A>, Duktak on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Pristine_Jade_Idol.JPG">Pristine Jade Idol</A>, Schena on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/sleeves_of_elemental_auras.jpg">Sleeves of Elemental Auras</A> and Greylok on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/lava_infused_bludgeon.jpg">Lava Infused Bludgeon</A>!&nbsp;&nbsp; </P>
<P>Grabbed a couple of Tower bosses and got Jumped a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</A>, Moordread on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wand_of_the_Ice_Storm.gif">Wand of the Ice Storm</A> and Lairiel and Jakr both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</A>. And a rune for Colwn. </P>
<P>Grats Tearem on 61! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 10, 2004 :: Bombur gets second Zerker epic on Povar!</div><P>Thanks all for the help getting the little dwarfie his epic! Myseriously, despite all the time we spent in Wars Woods tracking for something, slaughtering, etc, it suddenly appeared after the patch today. I'm sure we're all just morons and missed it.. yah.. right.. <BR><BR>Second on Povar! <BR>Kerasian Axe of Ire<BR>2H Slashing<BR>46/37<BR>AC:5<BR>Effect: Rage of Keras (Worn) +40 attack 40% haste<BR>STR: 15&nbsp; DEX: 15 STA: 20 HP: 125&nbsp; ENDURANCE: 100 SV FIRE:8&nbsp; SV DISEASE: 10 SVCOLD: 15 SVMAGIC: 7 SVPOISON: 10</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/bomepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR>Particle effects are on the new graphic engine.. so there is nothing to see until that's added to the game. </P>
<P>Grats Emmajo on 65!<BR>Grats Ashpaw on 64!<BR>Grats Lovem on 60!<BR>Grats Dawney and Shatta on 56!<BR>Grats Papa on Marshall!</P>
<P>Wil update the stuff and drops later... </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 10, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=1'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp; <a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a> 2 <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a> <a href='news.asp?page=4'>4</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=3'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
